    "metadata": {
      "title": "Apache Log4j2 JNDI 注入（Log4Shell）",
      "cve": "CVE-2021-44228",
      "severity": "critical",
      "source_cvss": "10.0",
      "product": "Apache Log4j2 (log4j-core)",
      "versions": "2.0-beta9 至 2.14.1",
      "ports": "8080, 8443, 443, 9200, 8983",
      "keywords": "log4j, log4shell, jndi, ldap, rmi, dnslog",
      "verified": "false",
      "sources": "NVD / 厂商公告 / 公开分析（见文末参考）"
    },
    "metadata_origin": "uploaded-archive-frontmatter",
    "source_sections": {
      "fingerprint": true,
      "preconditions": true,
      "remediation": true,
      "references": true
    },
    "remediation_source": "- 升级 `log4j-core` 到 `2.17.0+`（2.16.0 已移除 JNDI 支持；2.15.0 只在默认配置下有效）。\n- 临时：`-Dlog4j2.formatMsgNoLookups=true`（仅 2.10+），或从 jar 中删除 `org/apache/logging/log4j/core/lookup/JndiLookup.class`，或 `log4j2.component.properties` 里关 lookup。\n- 检测：全盘搜 `log4j-core-*.jar` 与 jar 内是否含 `JndiLookup.class`。",
    "reference_notes": "- NVD CVE-2021-44228；Apache Log4j Security Vulnerabilities 页面；LunaSec log4shell 分析。",
    "mirror_url": "https://github.com/sanjiu2024/dsh-team-workflow/blob/c55070e2858c1677bbebaf6ec1e8f13dad366cd6/skills/kb-java-deser/cve-2021-44228-log4shell.md"
  },
