    "id": "fujiang:java-deser:cve-2022-22965-spring4shell",
    "category": "java-deser",
    "source_ref": "plugin/knowledge/java-deser/cve-2022-22965-spring4shell.md",
    "metadata": {
      "title": "Spring Framework 数据绑定 RCE（Spring4Shell）",
      "cve": "CVE-2022-22965",
      "severity": "critical",
      "source_cvss": "9.8",
      "product": "Spring Framework + Tomcat (WAR 部署)",
      "versions": "5.3.0-5.3.17、5.2.0-5.2.19，JDK 9+",
      "ports": "8080, 8443",
      "keywords": "spring, spring4shell, classloader, tomcat, accessLogValve",
      "verified": "false",
      "sources": "NVD / 厂商公告 / 公开分析（见文末参考）"
    },
    "metadata_origin": "uploaded-archive-frontmatter",
    "source_sections": {
      "fingerprint": true,
      "preconditions": true,
      "remediation": true,
      "references": true
    },
    "remediation_source": "- Spring Framework 升到 `5.3.18+` / `5.2.20+`（`WebDataBinder` 默认拒绝 `class.*`）。\n- 临时：控制器加 `@InitBinder` 并 `setDisallowedFields(\"class.*\", \"Class.*\", \"*.class.*\", \"*.Class.*\")`；Tomcat 侧限制 `pattern` 属性；WAF 拦 `class.module.classLoader`。\n- 顺带排查同源：`CVE-2022-22963`（Spring Cloud Function SpEL）、`CVE-2022-22947`（Gateway Actuator SpEL）。",
    "reference_notes": "- NVD CVE-2022-22965；Spring 官方公告；Spring4Shell 公开分析。",
    "mirror_url": "https://github.com/sanjiu2024/dsh-team-workflow/blob/c55070e2858c1677bbebaf6ec1e8f13dad366cd6/skills/kb-java-deser/cve-2022-22965-spring4shell.md"
  },
