    "metadata": {
      "title": "Fastjson autoType 反序列化 RCE",
      "cve": "CVE-2022-25845",
      "severity": "high",
      "source_cvss": "8.1",
      "product": "com.alibaba:fastjson",
      "versions": "<= 1.2.80（另 CVE-2017-18349 等历史链）",
      "ports": "8080, 8443",
      "keywords": "fastjson, autotype, jdbcrowsetimpl, jndi, json",
      "verified": "false",
      "sources": "NVD / 厂商公告 / 公开分析（见文末参考）"
    },
    "metadata_origin": "uploaded-archive-frontmatter",
    "source_sections": {
      "fingerprint": true,
      "preconditions": true,
      "remediation": true,
      "references": true
    },
    "remediation_source": "- 升级到 `1.2.83+`，并显式 `ParserConfig.getGlobalInstance().setSafeMode(true)`（业务不用 autoType 时）。\n- 反序列化一律走白名单 `JSONReader.Feature`；拒绝不可信输入。",
    "reference_notes": "- NVD CVE-2022-25845；Fastjson 安全公告与 autoType 黑名单变更记录。",
